## 3. Główne ścieżki w Firebase Realtime Database

| Ścieżka                               | Opis                                                       |
| ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `players/{playerId}`                  | Profil gracza: firstName, lastName, nick, div, email, uid, |
|                                       | penaltyPoints, leave, dartcounter, avatarUrl, photoUrl,    |
|                                       | isDisqualified, isVerified, verified, avg, max, checkout,  |
|                                       | short, verifyAvgScreen, verifyCamScreen, verifyAvg,        |
|                                       | verifyCam, enrolledSeason, mergedInto, mergedAt, role,     |
|                                       | currentDivision, createdAt                                 |
| `players/{playerId}/penalties/{key}`  | Kara punktowa gracza w danym sezonie/dywizji               |
| `schedule/{matchKey}`                 | Mecz: p1Id/p2Id, p1Name/p2Name, score1/score2, legs1/legs2,|
|                                       | round, div, group, status, isWalkover, walkoverPlayerId,   |
|                                       | verified, verifiedAt, pendingProtocol, proposedDate/Time,  |
|                                       | proposedTimestamp, proposerId, booking, p1Stats/p2Stats,   |
|                                       | proofUrl1/proofUrl2, screen1/screen2, playedAt, season,    |
|                                       | isPlayoff, isDoubleWO, homePlayerId/awayPlayerId           |
| `penalties/{penaltyId}`               | Rekord kary: playerId, points, reason, adminId, createdAt  |
| `news/{newsId}`                       | News: title, content, authorId, createdAt, published       |
| `polls/{pollId}`                      | Ankieta: question, options, votes, createdAt, active       |
| `polls/{pollId}/votes/{playerId}`     | Głos pojedynczego gracza w ankiecie                        |
| `cup/`                                | Główny węzeł pucharu                                       |
| `cup/participants/{playerId}`         | Uczestnik pucharu (id, firstName, lastName, nick, div)     |
| `cup/groups/{groupName}`              | Lista ID graczy w grupie                                   |
| `cup/schedule/{matchKey}`             | Mecze fazy grupowej/KO pucharu                             |
| `cup/settings/`                       | Ustawienia pucharu (status, groupCount, type)              |
| `cup/bracket/`                        | Drabinka (generated, totalRounds, qualifiedCount)          |
| `settings/`                           | Ogólne ustawienia ligi (klucz-wartość)                     |
| `settings/adminEmails`                | Lista emaili adminów/sędziów (tablica stringów)            |
| `settings/socialStats`                | Social media: discord, tiktok, facebook                    |
| `settings/leagueStructure/{level}`    | Konfiguracja poziomu: promo, playoffs, releg               |
| `settings/rules`                      | Treść regulaminu (content + updatedAt)                     |
| `divisionsSettings/{divisionId}`      | Per-dywizja: promo, playoffs, releg, updatedAt             |
| `notifications/{notifId}`             | Powiadomienie: playerId, title, message, read, sentBy      |
| `achievements/{playerId}/trophies`    | Puchary sezonowe (ceremoniarz)                             |
| `achievements/{playerId}/`            | career_stats, epic_moments (archeolog)                     |
| `archive/season_{N}`                  | Dane archiwalne sezonu (osobna instancja DB / REST)       |
| `waitlist/{playerId}`                 | Poczekalnia – gracze oczekujący na akceptację              |

**Konwencja kluczy meczów:**
- Liga: `S{season}-{division}-R{round}-M{counter}` (np. `S4-DYWIZJA_1-R1-M1`)
- Puchar grupy: `{cupId}-G{group}-R{round}-M{counter}`
- Puchar KO: `CUP-KO-R{round}-M{counter}`
